<title>UK: Region Nord Pas de Calais sets 500 mln Ffr bond.</title>
<headline>Region Nord Pas de Calais sets 500 mln Ffr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Caisse des Depots et Consignations.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REGION NORD PAS DE CALAIS</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  MBIA ASSURANCE SA. (MOODYS/S&amp;P AAA/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    500 NLM FFR   COUPON     5.85	MATURITY    16.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.779   PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.30	REOFFER    99.829    SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC   1.15</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 7.75 PCT 2005 AND 7.25 PCT</p>
<p>			    2006 OATS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
